| **What** | **Why** | **Problem solved** | **Expected benefit** | **Cost/complexity** | **Priority** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Packet-loss and queue-depth telemetry alongside utilization | Queue occupancy rises before loss occurs, giving an earlier warning than utilization alone; both are standard, low-cost telemetry additions on switches that already support streaming telemetry | Congestion events that look fine on utilization alone but are already causing loss/microbursts | Earlier, more reliable congestion detection at negligible additional cost on already-telemetry-capable switches | Low (same telemetry pipeline, additional counters) | SHOULD HAVE |
